[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_30xkj")
section_name = "Relics"
img = ExtResource("1_hpxsb")
info = "[center][color='yellow']RELICS[/color]
Relics are special items that provide passive effects when equipped. Once a relic is equipped it works automatically in battle without any input needed from you.
Each relic has its own specific attribute value that determines how much of an effect it provides. For example a relic that restores health will heal you by a set amount every turn without you having to do anything.
Take your time to read what each relic does and experiment with different combinations. The right relic equipped at the right time can make a noticeable difference.

[color='yellow']Note: Can be purchased in the shop[/color][/center]"
